            "duration": 3456,
            "fileSize": 55912006
          },
          "description": "Wherever Nana and the grandkids go, there’s always something wonderful to hear—waves crashing at the beach, hammers banging at a construction site, or birds singing on a hike. But just when everyone is enjoying the sounds of the world... Uh-oh, Baby’s up!    \n\nBaby always wakes up at the funniest moments, filling the air with wails, babbles, and giggles. Will Baby ever settle down? With Nana’s patience and the big kids’ playful help, Baby always finds something to love—just in time for another silly surprise!    \n\nFull of soundscapes, humor, and heart, Uh-Oh, Baby’s Up! is a playful listening adventure that turns everyday places into exciting, noisy fun!    \n\nFarm: From mooing cows to clucking chickens, the farm is full of fun sounds—especially when Baby joins in!    \nConstruction Site: It's a noisy day of cranes, drills, and diggers, but Baby finds a way to make even more noise!    \nHike: Crunchy leaves, chirping birds... and one very loud Baby! Can Nana and the kids enjoy nature’s sounds?    \nBeach: Nana and the kids enjoy the waves, seagulls, and sandy fun—until Baby wakes up and makes a splash!    \nSchool: The school bell rings, the bus honks, and Baby wakes up just in time to add to the classroom commotion!",
          "author": "Yoto",
